WEBVTT

00:00.100 --> 00:03.968
Episode 4
A Sacrifice

00:16.483 --> 00:18.348
Togakushi Shrine

01:20.214 --> 01:23.411
The Divine Sword
has been taken,

01:23.517 --> 01:26.213
and two Kamuis?

01:27.488 --> 01:29.353
Two Divine Swords...

01:29.456 --> 01:31.515
Two Kamuis...

01:31.625 --> 01:33.286
Why?

01:51.045 --> 01:53.013
What's wrong, Miss Kanoe?

01:53.113 --> 01:54.512
You look rather pale.

01:55.983 --> 01:58.747
It must be because you're
peeping into people's dreams.

02:02.456 --> 02:05.289
The Divine Sword was hidden
in Togakushi Shrine.

02:06.393 --> 02:07.758
Apparently, it's been stolen.

02:09.830 --> 02:11.263
Who in the world would do that?

02:12.499 --> 02:16.060
It can't possibly be
that amusing Osaka boy, can it?

02:16.170 --> 02:17.432
I have no idea.

02:30.117 --> 02:32.176
But that was a strange dream...

02:35.456 --> 02:37.287
Two Divine Swords...

02:37.391 --> 02:38.483
And two Kamuis...

02:39.593 --> 02:41.925
What does this all mean,
my sister Hinoto?

02:50.504 --> 02:54.201
The composition of this sword is
different from ordinary minerals.

02:54.308 --> 02:56.799
In fact, it closely resembles
organic material.

02:56.910 --> 03:00.573
Furthermore,
like organic metabolisms...

03:00.681 --> 03:03.275
...it has the ability to continuously
repair and reproduce itself.

03:03.383 --> 03:05.146
These are amazing results.

03:05.252 --> 03:07.220
I have to say
that this sword is alive.

03:08.555 --> 03:09.852
Just as I thought.

03:10.924 --> 03:13.722
President, what in the world
is this sword?

03:14.928 --> 03:17.089
That's something
you don't have to know.

03:17.197 --> 03:21.327
Before that, solidify our
security measures even further.

03:21.435 --> 03:22.333
Yes, sir.

03:30.911 --> 03:32.845
Someday, he will come.

03:32.946 --> 03:35.506
The one who will
take away that Divine Sword.

03:35.616 --> 03:37.015
I'm sure of it.

03:37.117 --> 03:40.678
Whether he is a Dragon of Heaven
or a Dragon of Earth...

03:55.669 --> 03:56.966
Any changes?

03:57.070 --> 03:58.503
Not anything specific.

03:58.605 --> 04:01.005
Blood pressure and pulse
are both normal.

04:02.509 --> 04:04.170
Looking at him like this...

04:04.278 --> 04:06.473
He's just like a pretty,
little doll.

04:08.148 --> 04:10.673
But from a genetic point of view...

04:10.784 --> 04:12.183
...he's perfectly human.

04:13.620 --> 04:16.817
I heard that you were the one...

04:16.924 --> 04:18.721
...who named him Nataku,
President.

04:21.528 --> 04:25.931
It is the name of a god
with no soul in Chinese mythology.

04:27.067 --> 04:30.969
At first, he was born
just as a lump of flesh.

04:31.071 --> 04:34.131
He was then recreated
as a human with a body.

04:34.241 --> 04:39.941
However, in the end,
no soul rested inside his body.

04:41.949 --> 04:44.611
The same can be said
for this Nataku as well.

04:44.718 --> 04:47.551
His body is human,
but he has no heart.

04:47.654 --> 04:49.849
He lacks emotions.

04:49.957 --> 04:52.619
He does not feel sad
or feel any pain.

04:52.726 --> 04:55.957
He has nobody to love
and nobody to hate.

04:56.063 --> 04:59.499
He is just an organism
who continues to live.

05:05.305 --> 05:08.638
Everything is for
the End of the World.

05:33.467 --> 05:35.458
He apparently had a heart attack.

05:36.536 --> 05:38.436
He hasn't regained
consciousness yet...

05:38.538 --> 05:41.564
...but they said that
for now the worst is over.

05:41.675 --> 05:44.576
The doctors
mentioned possibilities...

05:44.678 --> 05:46.908
...of a strong shock
to the chest area.

05:47.014 --> 05:49.278
But they're not exactly sure
what caused this.

05:51.051 --> 05:54.179
To think that Dad
would end up like this...

05:54.288 --> 05:56.848
But I'm sure he'll get better.

05:56.957 --> 05:58.686
Dad was born a strong man.

06:02.195 --> 06:03.423
That's true.

06:03.530 --> 06:05.259
I'm sure he'll get better.

06:05.365 --> 06:08.994
Until then, if there's anything
we can do to help, speak up.

06:09.102 --> 06:10.194
Thank you.

06:10.304 --> 06:11.669
S-Sure.

06:13.840 --> 06:15.068
Leave it to us.

06:22.149 --> 06:23.047
Kamui...

06:24.318 --> 06:26.343
Don't blame yourself too much.

06:27.788 --> 06:28.652
I...

06:29.723 --> 06:33.659
...was planning to leave as soon as
I was given the Divine Sword.

06:33.760 --> 06:36.024
But someone stopped me...

06:36.129 --> 06:37.994
If he hurried and gave it to me...

06:38.098 --> 06:40.532
I understand how you feel.

06:40.634 --> 06:42.829
But this might be
how it was destined.

06:44.104 --> 06:46.902
The old Stargazer said this...

06:47.007 --> 06:49.168
"Kamui's Divine Sword..."

06:49.276 --> 06:54.771
Kamui's Divine Sword will be taken
by one of the Seven Angels.

06:54.881 --> 06:59.716
And when it shows itself
in front of Kamui again...

06:59.820 --> 07:03.381
...the Divine Sword
will have changed its shape.

07:05.525 --> 07:07.891
I'm not sure what he meant,

07:07.994 --> 07:10.758
but whether you like it or not...

07:10.864 --> 07:12.422
...the battle has already begun.

07:15.035 --> 07:16.696
The End of the World.

07:16.803 --> 07:18.464
The Promised Day.

07:18.572 --> 07:20.472
Is that what you were
talking about?

07:20.574 --> 07:21.632
That's right.

07:21.742 --> 07:23.539
The Final Battle.

07:23.643 --> 07:26.305
We all gathered here
for just that purpose.

07:26.413 --> 07:28.506
As members of the Seven Seals.

07:36.156 --> 07:37.748
Kamui...

07:37.858 --> 07:39.257
I...

07:39.359 --> 07:41.384
...don't remember
my parents' faces.

07:42.462 --> 07:44.657
The monk who picked me up
when I was three...

07:44.765 --> 07:47.996
...following the old Stargazer's
predictions, once told me...

07:49.903 --> 07:52.269
My mom didn't want
to give me up,

07:52.372 --> 07:54.806
so she held onto me
and didn't let go.

07:56.877 --> 07:59.437
And she saw me off in tears...

08:00.614 --> 08:03.481
in the rain, for a long time...

08:03.583 --> 08:04.914
for a long time...

08:06.887 --> 08:09.447
Maybe it was
on a rainy day like this.

08:10.690 --> 08:12.715
I don't remember it
at all, though.

08:17.998 --> 08:22.059
So I don't know how tough it is to lose
your only relative to death...

08:23.170 --> 08:27.300
But I think I know how heavy
the destiny on your shoulders must be.

08:35.882 --> 08:38.510
I understand at least
a small portion of it.

08:39.953 --> 08:41.420
Who is it?

08:41.521 --> 08:42.988
Kamui.

08:43.089 --> 08:46.354
I am your one and only
blood relative.

08:46.460 --> 08:47.620
Blood relative?

08:47.727 --> 08:48.591
That's right.

08:48.695 --> 08:50.458
I should resemble someone...

08:51.565 --> 08:52.896
Your mother, that is.

09:14.187 --> 09:14.209
Togakushi Shrine

09:16.756 --> 09:20.317
That individual took
Kamui away and escaped.

09:20.427 --> 09:24.056
I believe it was indeed an Angel
that took the Divine Sword.

09:24.164 --> 09:25.927
I believe that to be the case.

09:27.000 --> 09:30.060
Princess Hinoto, I have one thing
I don't understand.

09:30.170 --> 09:32.365
The fact the Divine Sword
was hidden here...

09:32.472 --> 09:35.100
...was something that only you
and a few others knew.

09:35.208 --> 09:36.937
But still, why...

09:37.043 --> 09:39.739
That is something
that even I do not know.

09:39.846 --> 09:40.744
I see.

09:42.082 --> 09:43.845
There is one more thing...

09:43.950 --> 09:45.076
...I must tell you.

09:49.289 --> 09:52.520
There was someone who followed
the Angel with Kamui.

09:52.626 --> 09:55.322
That is one of the Seals,
just like you are.

09:55.428 --> 09:57.521
He is the visitor from Kouya.

09:57.631 --> 09:59.030
Kouya?

09:59.132 --> 10:02.624
So one of the Seals
really was from Kouya.

10:02.736 --> 10:04.931
Then I will speak
with you again later.

10:49.749 --> 10:52.377
I am your mother's
younger sister.

10:52.485 --> 10:54.453
That means I am your aunt.

10:54.554 --> 10:57.250
My name is Tokiko Magami.

10:57.357 --> 11:00.656
You've heard that your mother's
maiden name was Magami, right?

11:00.760 --> 11:01.852
No.

11:01.962 --> 11:02.860
I see...

11:04.164 --> 11:07.827
My sister Tohru passed away
without telling you anything...

11:07.934 --> 11:11.131
But I'm glad that I got to meet
my nephew like this.

11:12.405 --> 11:14.464
Do you... know?

11:15.976 --> 11:18.308
Why... my mother died?

11:19.379 --> 11:20.710
Yes.

11:20.814 --> 11:23.840
I came here today
to tell you exactly that.

11:36.429 --> 11:38.454
My sister Tohru...

11:38.565 --> 11:40.624
...should have died
enveloped in flames.

11:41.735 --> 11:42.633
Am I right?

11:45.005 --> 11:47.235
My sister took her own life.

11:55.649 --> 11:58.209
Are you saying it's suicide?

11:58.318 --> 12:01.287
No, there can be only one reason...

12:01.388 --> 12:03.913
she died in place
of someone else.

12:04.024 --> 12:05.013
In someone's place?

12:05.125 --> 12:06.114
Yes.

12:06.226 --> 12:08.922
That's expected from
someone of Magami blood.

12:10.230 --> 12:11.993
Magami?

12:12.098 --> 12:14.566
"Ma" as in "truth"
and "gami" as in "god"?

12:14.668 --> 12:18.229
The Magami clan...
as in the Shadow Sacrifice?

12:18.338 --> 12:21.136
Looks like you're
not an ordinary boy.

12:21.241 --> 12:22.970
Tell Kamui what that means.

12:23.076 --> 12:24.475
T-That's true.

12:25.578 --> 12:28.570
The Magami clan are
all Shadow Sacrifices.

12:28.682 --> 12:30.377
Shadow Sacrifices?

12:30.483 --> 12:32.314
Yeah.

12:32.419 --> 12:35.684
There's an old magic spell
called a "scapegoat doll"

12:35.789 --> 12:38.952
where the doll accepts others'
misfortunes and ill omens.

12:39.059 --> 12:42.426
The Shadow Sacrifice, in other words,
is a living "scapegoat doll."

12:42.529 --> 12:46.556
They become "shadows" of nobles
or important politicians,

12:46.666 --> 12:51.160
and are sacrifices that accept
all of their masters' misfortunes.

12:51.271 --> 12:54.206
Who their masters really are
is a top secret.

12:55.809 --> 12:57.242
One theory claims that...

12:57.343 --> 13:01.245
...about half our Prime Ministers
were under their protection.

13:04.117 --> 13:06.085
So, Kamui...

13:06.186 --> 13:07.346
Your mother, too...

13:08.621 --> 13:10.088
Whose place did she take?

13:13.927 --> 13:18.489
My sister Tohru left our house
when I was still in junior high.

13:18.598 --> 13:19.792
She told me then...

13:20.867 --> 13:23.631
"I am currently with
a certain person's child.

13:23.737 --> 13:27.673
This child will someday hold the key
to what happens to the world."

13:28.775 --> 13:30.436
She meant you, Kamui.

13:32.045 --> 13:33.410
That's why my sister...

13:33.513 --> 13:37.506
...burned away, carrying all
the misfortunes that will befall you.

13:38.852 --> 13:40.615
As your Shadow Sacrifice.

13:44.124 --> 13:46.718
I-Impossible...

13:46.826 --> 13:47.952
That's true.

13:48.061 --> 13:49.585
I can understand.

13:49.696 --> 13:52.358
You don't know
what you really are yet.

13:55.368 --> 13:56.562
Kamui.

13:56.669 --> 13:59.331
There's one more thing
I have to tell you.

13:59.439 --> 14:02.203
It's about the Divine Sword
that was taken from you.

14:03.476 --> 14:06.411
I don't know where
the stolen Divine Sword is.

14:06.513 --> 14:09.414
But a Divine Sword will someday
fall into your hands.

14:09.516 --> 14:10.608
Why is that?

14:10.717 --> 14:13.515
There is another Divine Sword
that you are destined to hold.

14:14.621 --> 14:19.024
"Kamui's Divine Sword will be taken
by one of the Seven Angels.

14:19.125 --> 14:22.219
And when it shows itself
in front of Kamui again...

14:22.328 --> 14:25.491
...the Divine Sword
will have changed its shape."

14:25.598 --> 14:26.860
I heard that, as well.

14:26.966 --> 14:27.990
That's right.

14:28.101 --> 14:30.899
In other words,
two Divine Swords exist.

14:31.004 --> 14:34.735
The one that was taken,
and the one that you will later hold.

14:34.841 --> 14:36.103
Where is it?

14:37.377 --> 14:40.369
It still hasn't materialized
in this world yet.

14:41.481 --> 14:45.417
Such a story is even
more impossible to believe.

14:45.518 --> 14:47.577
Everything that
you've said, that is.

14:57.497 --> 14:59.727
I guess I must fight
inside a Barrier Field.

15:09.642 --> 15:10.836
A Barrier Field...

15:10.944 --> 15:12.605
Someone put up a Barrier Field!

15:15.215 --> 15:16.614
It's toward the hospital.

15:16.716 --> 15:18.274
Kamui.

15:18.384 --> 15:21.649
The other Divine Sword will someday
fall into your hands.

15:21.754 --> 15:22.846
I'll see you then.

15:25.959 --> 15:27.119
Wait, Kamui!

15:27.227 --> 15:28.125
I'll go with you!

15:29.596 --> 15:31.257
I'll see you again...

15:31.364 --> 15:32.262
...Kamui.

16:02.528 --> 16:03.552
Who is that?

16:03.663 --> 16:05.187
How is he inside
the Barrier Field?

16:15.408 --> 16:16.306
Run away!

16:25.551 --> 16:26.882
A windmaster?

16:39.465 --> 16:40.557
That's useless.

17:10.029 --> 17:12.896
I wonder who sent
these Spell Servants after us?

17:14.467 --> 17:15.991
Could it be a Dragon of Earth's...

17:16.102 --> 17:18.127
...one of the Seven Angels' doings?

17:20.807 --> 17:23.241
But anyway, that was
a marvelous Barrier Field.

17:23.343 --> 17:25.971
I can't possibly
make one like that.

17:26.079 --> 17:27.478
Then you're...

17:28.581 --> 17:31.141
I'm in the same situation
that you are.

17:31.250 --> 17:35.914
One of the Dragons of Heaven.
One of the Seven Seals.

17:40.760 --> 17:42.853
Oh, no! It's from
the editorial office!

17:42.962 --> 17:45.123
Hello, who are
you trying to contact?

17:45.231 --> 17:46.198
Wrong number.

17:46.299 --> 17:47.391
Sure.

17:47.500 --> 17:48.364
I'm sorry.

17:48.468 --> 17:52.427
It was nice finally meeting you,
but I have to go back to work.

17:52.538 --> 17:54.165
I'll see you again!

17:54.273 --> 17:55.171
See you!

18:02.582 --> 18:04.777
If you don't mind, take this.

18:04.884 --> 18:06.977
Girls shouldn't chill
their bodies too much.

18:09.389 --> 18:10.947
Well, this time for real.

18:18.498 --> 18:19.396
Monthly ASUKA Editorial Office

18:19.499 --> 18:22.297
Seiichiro Aoki, editor...

18:23.469 --> 18:24.834
What are you doing here?

18:30.209 --> 18:31.301
Kamui...

18:31.411 --> 18:32.776
It's you.

18:35.214 --> 18:36.704
What were you doing?

18:36.816 --> 18:39.944
Depending on the answer,
I won't let you go unharmed.

18:40.053 --> 18:41.816
Wait a minute...

18:41.921 --> 18:44.185
Did you put up
the Barrier Field here?

18:44.290 --> 18:46.690
You must be the visitor
from Kouya, then?

18:46.793 --> 18:50.752
Which means that you, missie,
are one of the Seven Seals.

18:52.131 --> 18:53.894
This missie here is on our side.

18:55.034 --> 18:57.559
I just met another one of us.

18:57.670 --> 18:59.433
Another one?

18:59.539 --> 19:00.471
I see.

19:00.573 --> 19:02.063
They're all gathering now.

19:03.176 --> 19:06.805
We just met up with Kamui's aunt,
one of the Magami clan.

19:06.913 --> 19:08.778
Magami?

19:08.881 --> 19:09.813
The Shadow Sacrifice?

19:09.916 --> 19:13.374
Oh? It looks like you're in
this industry as well, missie.

19:13.486 --> 19:14.350
Then you're...

19:14.454 --> 19:17.218
...the greatest, modern spiritualist
from the Sumeragi clan.

19:17.323 --> 19:18.551
No...

19:18.658 --> 19:20.523
The one from Ise,
by any chance?

19:21.661 --> 19:22.958
Bingo...

19:23.062 --> 19:24.689
...huh?

19:24.797 --> 19:25.729
Hey, Kamui.

19:25.832 --> 19:27.561
That story Ms. Magami told us...

19:27.667 --> 19:30.067
You didn't believe it, right?

19:30.169 --> 19:31.466
Of course not.

19:31.571 --> 19:34.301
Then don't you want to hear
a more detailed version?

19:34.407 --> 19:37.274
From someone who knows
what you really are very well...

19:38.811 --> 19:39.800
All right.

19:39.912 --> 19:42.472
Let's have this missie
from Ise guide us there.

19:42.582 --> 19:43.810
To where?

19:43.916 --> 19:45.975
Don't play dumb with me...

19:46.085 --> 19:48.383
I've heard from
the old Stargazer...

19:48.488 --> 19:52.083
...that a dreaming princess lives
underneath the Diet Building.

19:58.564 --> 19:59.588
Missie...

19:59.699 --> 20:01.132
You're quite beautiful.

20:03.803 --> 20:05.737
That's it.
I've decided on you, missie.

20:06.839 --> 20:09.137
- What do you mean by that?
- Well, Kamui...

20:09.242 --> 20:12.643
Let's have that princess
give us the rest of the details.

20:17.650 --> 20:19.049
Ow, ow, ow...

20:20.753 --> 20:22.186
You're so cold.
